<title>UGANDA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CUP WINNERS' CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CUP WINNERS' CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Umeme SC (Uganda) beat Awassa</p>
<p>Flour Mill (Ethiopia) 3-0 (halftime 3-0) in an African Cup</p>
<p>Winners' Cup preliminary round, second leg match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Iddi Batambuze 10, Charles Ogwang 40, 42</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>Umeme SC win 5-0 on aggregate 5-0</p>
</text>
